    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Two kilometres from Grimaud village, Le Verger Maelvi takes the form of a Mediterranean villa with a pool and garden — a quiet base about fifteen kilometres from Saint-Tropez.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you book</h2>
      <p>The establishment appears both on Grimaud tourist office's official list of dog-friendly accommodation and on a directory specialised in travelling with dogs. The precise conditions (size, possible supplement) are not published: it's best to confirm them directly before booking.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: ask whether nearby beaches are accessible to dogs out of season, a good way to extend the walk after a dip in the pool.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Grimaud village and Saint-Tropez are both reachable by car from the hotel.</p>
